"The top row can open features such as Spotlight instead of sending F4. Try holding Fn (Globe) together with Option (Alt) and F4. You can also send us this result with one click." = "顶排按键可能会打开聚焦搜索等功能，而不是发送 F4。请尝试同时按住 Fn（地球仪键）、Option（Alt）和 F4。也可以一键将测试结果发送给我们。";
