"This shortcut has no replacement here" = "此快捷键在当前预览中没有对应转换";
"To close a window, hold Option (Alt) and press F4. On a MacBook, you may also need to hold Fn (Globe). The report already includes what your Mac received." = "要关闭窗口，请按住 Option（Alt）并按 F4。在 MacBook 上，可能还需要同时按住 Fn（地球仪键）。报告已包含 Mac 实际收到的按键信息。";
