"Windsify found a legacy license key without its activation record. No new seat was used. Release the old device in the Polar customer portal before activating again." = "Windsify 发现旧版许可证密钥，但缺少激活记录。本次未占用新名额。请先在 Polar 客户门户中释放旧设备，再重新激活。";
"Windsify needs Accessibility permission to use shortcuts in other apps. Open Accessibility Settings below and allow Windsify." = "Windsify 需要辅助功能权限，才能在其他应用中使用快捷键。请通过下方按钮打开辅助功能设置，并允许 Windsify。";
"Windsify recognizes this shortcut" = "Windsify 已识别此快捷键";
