"Windsify would leave this key to the app, or it is not supported in this preview. Send us the result and we can investigate without asking you to collect technical details." = "Windsify 会将此按键原样交给应用，或此预览暂不支持该按键。将结果发给我们即可，无需另外收集技术信息。";
